## CONTEXT BAND AND HANDOVER
At about 70% context start no new part; at about 75% stop at a safe boundary (a part's commit made or not started, files whole, plants reverted by blob, every process you started stopped by pid, band 21280-21919 free, the lock released or your ticket named) and write `/Volumes/Datasec_DEV/!CODING/Datasec/NexusAI/1_Project_Definition/Briefs/2026-11-18_B1680_HANDOVER.md` (done / in hand / next / processes left / decisions a successor keeps: BASE, A, B, C, D, M, K, trees, run tallies, the measured cell counts, the ten H1 times and the margin, the `STOPMS` number and the PREDICTED-versus-received corrections) with last line `HANDOVER B1680: next <part> <step> | done <parts>`, and end STATUS with the same line. Parts: read, part A, part B, part C, measure, part D, cells, mutations, verify, push. **Write each part's commit before starting the next; the chain starts only when A, B and C are made.**

