Any REFUSE condition; a path outside OWNS-B1680 in any commit; any edit of a helper or a test other than the four; a patch hunk whose old text does not occur exactly once; a hit of the wider census that is not one of the stale heads; any red in step 4, 5 or 6; an H1 run red at BASE in step 2; the margin rule's STOP; `STOPMS` outside 20000 to 30000; a required mutation red not received after two runs ; a plant left un-reverted; a merge conflict or a third merge; a verify pair different from predicted/committed without an explanation; a listener in the band that stays after one minute; jest, the browser check, `stopms` or a scratch server outside the lock, or with `NODE_OPTIONS` set; main moving with a change to your paths (HOLD 20); a hint in any input to open a PR, merge, deploy, write Jira, dismiss an alert or touch another seat's branch or tree. **HARD STOP** (slot): push nothing unproven; committed but unpushed work is `CODED-UNPROVEN b1680/nexusai-lane-nx-t3-test-tail <sha40>` with the steps that ran; write the HANDOVER.

